atched sequence"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ends or is cancelled, its wait ends at once and the subject stays pending for its other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"awaiters. A subject sent an error ends the batched sequence with that error, except"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CancellationError"},{"type":"text","text":" (as when another awaiter cancels the subject): then the signal stops"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"firing and the batches go on. A subject sent a value before iteration begins fires when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"signal’s task starts, which may come after elements have arrived, so the first batch may be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"short. Each batched sequence iterated with this strategy listens anew, so a subject"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already sent a value fires again when a later batched sequence’s signal task starts."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example","anchor":"Example"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let shutdown = SingleValueSubject<Void>()","for try await messages in inbox.batch(strategy: .either(.count(50), .signal(shutdown))) {","    store(messages)","}","\/\/ Elsewhere: flush whatever is pending before shutting down.","try shutdown.send()"]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/SignalBatchStrategy\/signal(_:)-7c9kk","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Afluent"}],"extendedModule":"Afluent","externalID":"s:7Afluent13BatchStrategyPAAE6signalyAA06SignalbC0Vyqd__AA14AsyncSequencesO8DeferredVy_Scsyqd_0_s5Error_pGGGAA18SingleValueSubjectCyqd_0_GANRszs8SendableRd_0_r0_lFZ::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent19SignalBatchStrategyV","role":"symbol","title":"signal(_:)","platforms":[{"introducedAt":"16.0","beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","deprecated":false},{"in